Britten's young royals are making their  first official joint appearance together  this morning so that's Prince Harry and  his fiancee Megan Markel along with  Prince William and his wife Kate they're  speaking at a forum for charities today  Roxana Saberi is outside London's very  snowy Kensington Palace with a highly  anticipated joint engagement all for  them together Roxana good morning good  morning this snowstorm didn't stop  Prince Harry and Megan from leaving  their cottage here on the palace grounds  to join Prince William and Kate across  town they're highlighting the work of  the royal foundation set up by the two  princes in 2011 to support their  Charities of choice after Megan marries  Harry in May she'll join their royal  highnesses as the Foundation's fourth  patron what will happen when the royal  trio becomes a royal quartet well Megan  says she'll bring issues like gender  equality to the table you'll often hear  people say well you're helping women  find their voices and I fundamentally  disagree with that because women don't  need to find a voice they have a voice  they need to feel empowered to use it  and people need to be encouraged to  listen the Foundation supports 14  charities tackling issues like mental  health and wildlife conservation but  before Megan can share the workload is  something else to take care of I guess  we wait a couple months and then we can  hit the ground running but up until then  like you said I mean you've been here  for your wedding first  of course everyone here is looking  forward to May 19th when the four will  officially become a family Alex  hopefully the weather will be a little  better than May 19th mark the calendar  Roxana Saberi in London thanks Roxana
 

